      "message": "test(2d): pin the pecked tab window dives of contour-tabs\n\nPR #3866 (#3678) pecks the three later tab window dives of the\ncontour-tabs catalog case, so the #3679 verifier names no dive and the\nold expectation of three 6 mm findings failed on main.\n\nThe pin now asserts no PlungeTooDeep finding and that each dive column\non the last level steps Z 4, 2, 0, at most one 2 mm stepdown at a time.\nA second test keeps the law pinned end to end: the same case with its\ntop 4 mm under the stock top names its four 4 mm dives, advisory only.\n\nFixes #3925\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
